  "details": "I uploaded an avatar with 16 VRC Raycast components to force it down to Very Poor rank. The website reports it as Excellent. It's Excellent on Windows otherwise.\n\nA sample avatar (private): [Robot （Very Poor raycasts）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_714e8215-60da-434e-8d81-5264345f0465) (`avtr_714e8215-60da-434e-8d81-5264345f0465`)\n\nSteps to reproduce: Check the private avatar linked above, or create the depicted avatar with 16 VRC Raycast components.\n\nExpected behavior: Very Poor in the SDK, in-app (live & test avatar builds) and on the website.\n\nActual behavior: The website reports the avatar as Excellent performance rank, but in reality it's Very Poor in-app (live & test) and in the avatar SDK prediction.",
